Path pattern in source repo:
  symbols/web/<name>/materialsymbolsoutlined/<name>_24px.svg  ->  assets/<name>.svg

The SVG files are vendored unmodified from the revision above. They carry no
fixed `fill` attribute (implicit black), so the iced svg renderer's color
filter (`svg::Style { color }`) tints them directly — no `currentColor`
preprocessing was necessary.

